//! # Tutorial System
//!
//! In-game tutorials that teach mechanics through gameplay:
//! - Movement and interaction
//! - Alter switching and co-consciousness
//! - Reality layer perception
//! - Combat basics
//! - Dialogue navigation
//!
//! Tutorials appear contextually and can be dismissed or disabled.

use crate::system::*;
use crate::combat::combat::*;
use crate::runtime::state::*;
use qliphoth::prelude::*;

// ============================================================================
// TUTORIAL DEFINITIONS
// ============================================================================

